---
// Fig. for "Multivariate & Multilinear Polynomials": a multilinear
// polynomial has 2^n coefficients, exactly matching the 2^n corners of
// the Boolean hypercube {0,1}^n — shown here for n = 2.
---
<svg viewBox="0 0 760 560" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="width:100%;height:auto;display:block;">
  <text x="380" y="26" text-anchor="middle" fill="#e9eef5" font-size="16" font-weight="800" font-family="-apple-system,Arial,sans-serif">multilinear: each variable at most once</text>

  <rect x="40" y="46" width="680" height="42" rx="10" fill="#111c2e" stroke="#3ab7ff" stroke-width="1.5" />
  <text x="380" y="72" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8fdcff" font-size="13.5" font-weight="700" font-family="-apple-system,Arial,sans-serif">What if every variable may only appear to the power 1?</text>

  <text x="380" y="122" text-anchor="middle" font-family="SF Mono, Fira Code, Consolas, monospace">
    <tspan fill="#8b96a8" font-size="11.5" font-weight="700">ALLOWED&#160;&#160;&#160;</tspan><tspan fill="#5ddc8a" font-size="13.5" font-weight="700">3 + 2x + 5y + 4xy &#10003;</tspan>
  </text>

  <text x="380" y="154" text-anchor="middle" font-family="SF Mono, Fira Code, Consolas, monospace">
    <tspan fill="#8b96a8" font-size="11.5" font-weight="700">NOT ALLOWED&#160;&#160;&#160;</tspan><tspan fill="#ff5c7a" font-size="13.5" font-weight="700">x<tspan dy="-6" font-size="65%">2</tspan><tspan dy="6"> or x</tspan><tspan dy="-6" font-size="65%">2</tspan><tspan dy="6">y &#10007;</tspan></tspan>
  </text>

  <text x="380" y="186" text-anchor="middle" font-family="SF Mono, Fira Code, Consolas, monospace">
    <tspan fill="#8b96a8" font-size="11.5" font-weight="700">MONOMIALS&#160;&#160;&#160;</tspan><tspan fill="#e9eef5" font-size="13" font-weight="700">1, x, y, xy &#8594; 4 = 2<tspan dy="-6" font-size="65%">2</tspan><tspan dy="6"> coefficients. With n variables there are 2</tspan><tspan dy="-6" font-size="65%">n</tspan><tspan dy="6">.</tspan></tspan>
  </text>

  <!-- the Boolean hypercube {0,1}^2 -->
  <line x1="295" y1="230" x2="465" y2="230" stroke="#8fdcff" stroke-width="1.5" />
  <line x1="295" y1="400" x2="465" y2="400" stroke="#8fdcff" stroke-width="1.5" />
  <line x1="295" y1="230" x2="295" y2="400" stroke="#8fdcff" stroke-width="1.5" />
  <line x1="465" y1="230" x2="465" y2="400" stroke="#8fdcff" stroke-width="1.5" />
  <circle cx="295" cy="230" r="6" fill="#8fdcff" />
  <circle cx="465" cy="230" r="6" fill="#8fdcff" />
  <circle cx="295" cy="400" r="6" fill="#8fdcff" />
  <circle cx="465" cy="400" r="6" fill="#8fdcff" />
  <text x="280" y="234" text-anchor="end" fill="#e9eef5" font-size="14" font-weight="700" font-family="SF Mono, Fira Code, Consolas, monospace">(0, 1) &#8594; 8</text>
  <text x="480" y="234" text-anchor="start" fill="#e9eef5" font-size="14" font-weight="700" font-family="SF Mono, Fira Code, Consolas, monospace">(1, 1) &#8594; 14 = 1</text>
  <text x="280" y="404" text-anchor="end" fill="#e9eef5" font-size="14" font-weight="700" font-family="SF Mono, Fira Code, Consolas, monospace">(0, 0) &#8594; 3</text>
  <text x="480" y="404" text-anchor="start" fill="#e9eef5" font-size="14" font-weight="700" font-family="SF Mono, Fira Code, Consolas, monospace">(1, 0) &#8594; 5</text>
  <text x="380" y="430" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b96a8" font-size="12" font-family="SF Mono, Fira Code, Consolas, monospace">the Boolean hypercube {"{0, 1}"}<tspan dy="-6" font-size="65%">2</tspan><tspan dy="6">, all values in F(13)</tspan></text>

  <text x="380" y="464" text-anchor="middle" font-family="SF Mono, Fira Code, Consolas, monospace">
    <tspan fill="#8b96a8" font-size="11.5" font-weight="700">CHECK&#160;&#160;&#160;</tspan><tspan fill="#5ddc8a" font-size="13.5" font-weight="700">f(1, 1) = 3 + 2 + 5 + 4 = 14 = 1 &#10003;</tspan>
  </text>

  <line x1="40" y1="486" x2="720" y2="486" stroke="#223049" stroke-width="1" />
  <text x="380" y="510" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8fdcff" font-size="15.5" font-weight="800" font-family="-apple-system,Arial,sans-serif">2&#8319; COEFFICIENTS MATCH 2&#8319; CORNERS</text>
  <text x="380" y="532" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b96a8" font-size="12.5" font-family="-apple-system,Arial,sans-serif">The four corner values pin down the whole polynomial.</text>
</svg>
